1
00:00:00,113 --> 00:00:03,371
Logo ular di ambulans dan WHO...

2
00:00:03,371 --> 00:00:04,723
tongkat dewa Yunani,

3
00:00:04,723 --> 00:00:05,559
Asclepius.

4
00:00:05,559 --> 00:00:08,864
Kuilnya yang hilang di
Epidaurus akhirnya dipastikan!

5
00:00:08,864 --> 00:00:11,239
Lebih dari 1.800 tahun lalu,

6
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:13,343
penjelajah Pausanias mencatatnya,

7
00:00:13,343 --> 00:00:15,324
lalu lokasinya jadi teka-teki.

8
00:00:15,324 --> 00:00:16,216
Kuncinya:

9
00:00:16,216 --> 00:00:19,070
pecahan tembikar
bertuliskan nama Asclepius.

10
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:20,676
Di kuil Asclepius,

11
00:00:20,676 --> 00:00:22,338
orang sakit tidur semalaman,

12
00:00:22,338 --> 00:00:23,944
berharap disembuhkan lewat mimpi.

13
00:00:23,944 --> 00:00:25,296
Dan di lantainya...

14
00:00:25,296 --> 00:00:27,333
ular sungguhan merayap bebas!

15
00:00:27,333 --> 00:00:29,636
Berani tidur bareng ular demi sembuh?
